    ((((tmp>>(56))&(~(((1<<63)>>(56))<<1))))&255)\
)) \
)*PRIME64_2)));v1=$((((v1<<31)|((v1>>(33))&0x7fffffff) )*PRIME64_1))
            ((v2+=(($(( \
    (((tmp=0x${inp:16:16})<<56)&(255<<56))|\
    ((tmp<<40)&(255<<48))|\
    ((tmp<<24)&(255<<40))|\
    ((tmp<<8)&(255<<32))|\
